<p>At Glamora, we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring that your personal information is handled securely. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, and protect your data while using our website.</p>

<h2 id="content-ownership">Content Ownership</h2>
<p>All content on the Glamora website, including text, graphics, logos, images, button icons, and software, is the exclusive property of Glamora or its content providers and is protected by Indian copyright laws. You may electronically copy or print portions of the website solely for the purpose of placing an order or using the website as a shopping resource. Any other use, including reproduction, modification, or distribution of content, is strictly prohibited.</p>

<h2 id="trademarks">Trademarks</h2>
<p>All trademarks, logos, and service marks used on the website are proprietary to Glamora or other respective owners who have granted Glamora the right to use such intellectual property.</p>

<h2 id="registration-accounts-passwords">Registration, Accounts, and Passwords</h2>
<p>By creating an account on the Glamora website, you are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your password and any account information. You agree to inform Glamora immediately in case of any unauthorized use of your account or password. Glamora will not be held liable for any loss or damage resulting from your failure to protect your account details.</p>

<h2 id="governing-law">Governing Law</h2>
<p>This Privacy Policy is governed by the laws of India, without regard to any conflict of law principles.</p>

<h2 id="collecting-information">Collecting Information</h2>
<p>When you visit the Glamora website, we collect both personal information that you knowingly provide and interaction information from your use of the site. This may include your name, age, address, telephone number, email address, and payment information when you register, make purchases, or participate in promotions.</p>
<p>We may also combine the data you provide with information from other sources, including publicly available data, to better serve you and personalize your shopping experience.</p>

<h2 id="use-of-information">Use of Information</h2>
<p>We may use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
<ul>
  <li>To operate and improve our website and services</li>
  <li>To communicate with you about your purchases, account information, or customer service inquiries</li>
  <li>To send you promotional materials about products, events, or promotions</li>
  <li>To process orders and transactions</li>
  <li>To conduct market research and analyze website traffic</li>
  <li>To customize your shopping experience</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="sharing-information">Sharing Information</h2>
<p>We may share your information with our preferred service providers who assist us in operating the Glamora business, including payment processing, shipping, data management, and marketing services. These providers use your information solely to perform services for Glamora.</p>
<p>We may also disclose your information when required by law or to protect our rights or those of others. This includes sharing information with authorities in case of fraud investigations or other legal matters.</p>

<h2 id="protecting-your-information">Protecting Your Information</h2>
<p>We use security measures like encryption to protect your personal information. All payment information is transmitted via Secure Socket Layer (SSL) technology and encrypted in our databases. However, while we take these precautions, we cannot guarantee 100% security for your data, and Glamora is not responsible for unauthorized access due to your failure to protect your password or other account details.</p>

<h2 id="unsubscribing-modifying-information">Unsubscribing and Modifying Information</h2>
<p>You can modify or delete your account information by logging in and updating your profile. If you wish to unsubscribe from our emails, simply follow the instructions provided in any email you receive. If you request your account information be deleted, we may still maintain details of past transactions for future service and record-keeping.</p>

<h2 id="mobile-messaging">Mobile Messaging</h2>
<p>Please note that if you unsubscribe from Glamora emails, you may still receive messages related to ongoing transactions or services you have requested.</p>

<h2 id="childrens-privacy">Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13 years of age. If we become aware of any such information, we will delete it promptly.</p>

<h2 id="links-to-other-websites">Links to Other Websites</h2>
<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. Glamora is not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these websites. This Privacy Policy only applies to information collected through the Glamora website.</p>

<h2 id="terms-of-use">Terms of Use</h2>
<p>Your use of the Glamora website is subject to this Privacy Policy and our Terms of Use. Any disputes arising from the use of our website will be governed by the applicable laws of India.</p>

<h2 id="third-parties-and-links">Third Parties and Links</h2>
<p>We may share your data with third parties such as our agents or subcontractors for the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy. For instance, we may work with third parties for product delivery, payment collection, or fraud prevention. Glamora will not sell your personal data to third parties without your consent unless required by law.</p>

<p>If you have any questions or concerns about our Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:care@glamoracosmetics.co.in">care@glamoracosmetics.co.in</a></p>
